{"id": 425760, "field": "description", "ja": "脚部にSerpent Spreadのルーンを刻みます：\n\n$I1\nMulti-Shotが命中した対象は、$D1の間Serpent Stingにも冒されます。", "status": "unaligned", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "critic": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-inclusions-p3-sg11@2026-09-27", "imported": "2026-09-27"}, "english": {"hash": "5f415872dd62d5fb", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009", "includes": {"425738.description": "fd520141f84f7f7f"}}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 425762, "field": "description", "ja": "脚部にFlanking Strikeのルーンを刻みます：\n\n$I1\n自分とペットが同時に即時の近接攻撃を行い、$N1%の近接ダメージを与えます。その後、$D1の間与えるダメージが$N2%増加し、最大$N4回までスタックします。ペットのBasic攻撃は、$N5%の確率でFlanking Strikeのクールダウンをリセットします。", "status": "unaligned", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "critic": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-inclusions-p3-sg11@2026-09-27", "imported": "2026-09-27"}, "english": {"hash": "2cd65e380b18f1e4", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009", "includes": {"415320.description": "740af0fcb9a26d2a"}}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
