{"id": 425874, "field": "description", "ja": "対象の足元にhealth $N2のDecoy Totemを$D1の間召喚し、対象への次の近接攻撃または遠隔攻撃をトーテムにそらします。トーテムは対象に$D2の間、移動阻害効果への耐性も与えます。", "status": "unaligned", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-tooltip-run2-spell-03-sg5@2026-09-18", "imported": "2026-09-18"}, "english": {"hash": "4df50519b9447760", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 425882, "field": "description", "ja": "ブーツにDecoy Totemのルーンを刻みます：\n\n$I1\n対象の足元に、healthが$N2のDecoy Totemを$D1の間召喚します。対象への次の近接攻撃または遠隔攻撃は、代わりにトーテムに向けられます。さらにトーテムは、$D2の間、対象に移動妨害効果への耐性を与えます。", "status": "unaligned", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "critic": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-inclusions-p3-sg11@2026-09-27", "imported": "2026-09-27"}, "english": {"hash": "8e83f7254d01b3b6", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009", "includes": {"425874.description": "4df50519b9447760"}}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 425883, "field": "description", "ja": "ブーツにAncestral Awakeningのルーンを刻みます：\n\n$I1\nHealing WaveまたはLesser Healing Waveでクリティカル回復をすると、Ancestralの霊を召喚して助けを得ます。霊は40ヤード以内でhealthの割合が最も低いパーティーメンバーを、回復量の$N2%分即座に回復します。", "status": "unaligned", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "critic": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-inclusions-p3-sg11@2026-09-27", "imported": "2026-09-27"}, "english": {"hash": "9366949463dc8ed1", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009", "includes": {"425858.description": "d30bce977ddd9770"}}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
